<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Challenge 5 on Exoscale Academy</title><link>https://layer5io.github.io/exoscale-academy/pr-preview/pr-378/learning-paths/1e2a8e46-937c-47ea-ab43-5716e3bcab2e/workshop-cka-preparation/11.challenges/challenge5/</link><description>Recent content in Challenge 5 on Exoscale Academy</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en</language><atom:link href="https://layer5io.github.io/exoscale-academy/pr-preview/pr-378/learning-paths/1e2a8e46-937c-47ea-ab43-5716e3bcab2e/workshop-cka-preparation/11.challenges/challenge5/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Solution</title><link>https://layer5io.github.io/exoscale-academy/pr-preview/pr-378/learning-paths/1e2a8e46-937c-47ea-ab43-5716e3bcab2e/workshop-cka-preparation/11.challenges/challenge5/solution/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://layer5io.github.io/exoscale-academy/pr-preview/pr-378/learning-paths/1e2a8e46-937c-47ea-ab43-5716e3bcab2e/workshop-cka-preparation/11.challenges/challenge5/solution/</guid><description>&lt;ol>
&lt;li>Test&lt;/li>
&lt;/ol>
&lt;p>The single replica is not running&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash">&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>kubectl get deploy,po -n app1
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>NAME READY UP-TO-DATE AVAILABLE AGE
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>deployment.apps/nginx 0/1 &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff">1&lt;/span> &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff">0&lt;/span> 79m
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>NAME READY STATUS RESTARTS AGE
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>pod/nginx-7b4b5bbf6f-dth6d 0/1 ImagePullBackOff &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff">0&lt;/span> 79m
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;p>The description of the nginx Pod gives additional information&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash">&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>kubectl describe po pod/nginx-7b4b5bbf6f-dth6d
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>...
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>Events:
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> Type Reason Age From Message
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> ---- ------ ---- ---- -------
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> Normal BackOff 16s &lt;span style="color:#f92672">(&lt;/span>x351 over 80m&lt;span style="color:#f92672">)&lt;/span> kubelet Back-off pulling image &lt;span style="color:#e6db74">&amp;#34;ngnix:1.26&amp;#34;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;ol start="2">
&lt;li>Fix it&lt;/li>
&lt;/ol>
&lt;p>Edit the Deployment and replace the image name &lt;em>ngnix:1.26&lt;/em> with &lt;em>nginx:1.26&lt;/em>, a little typo can have big consequences :)&lt;/p></description></item></channel></rss>